  /// TierEditor · a description
  /// shown through TierEditor.description
  description "The levels of service an organisation can be on. An organisation's tier is what it is entitled to, and what a support or sales kit promises it by; its own contract can add more." => "De servicenivåer en organisation kan ha. En organisations nivå avgör vad den har rätt till och vad ett support- eller säljkit lovar den; dess eget avtal kan lägga till mer.";
